Users: Id | PatientId, Concat(FirstName, < >, LastName) | Patient, AgeOn(BirthDate, <2025-10-31>) | Age, PatientVisits.ChronicVisits | ChronicVisits, PatientVisits.CompletedVisits | CompletedVisits, PatientLabs.AbnormalResults | AbnormalResults, ROUND(PatientVisits.TotalCharges, <2>) | TotalCharges, PatientVisits.LastVisitDate | LastVisitDate
  Where PatientVisits.ChronicVisits > <0> AND PatientLabs.AbnormalResults > <0>
  Order AbnormalResults DESC, ChronicVisits DESC, TotalCharges DESC
  Skip 0
  Take 10
  Inner Join PatientVisits on Id = PatientVisits.UserId
  Inner Join PatientLabs on Id = PatientLabs.UserId

PatientVisits is Visits: UserId | UserId, CountIf(Diagnosis.IsChronic = <True>) | ChronicVisits, COUNT(Id) | CompletedVisits, SUM(Charge) | TotalCharges, MAX(VisitDate) | LastVisitDate
  Where Status = <Completed>

PatientLabs is LabResults: Visit.UserId | UserId, CountIf(IsAbnormal = <True>) | AbnormalResults
